    public string Id { get; set; }
    public string Name { get; set; }
}
````

### [ 00:08 ] 🤖 ASSISTANT
<think>
Now converting to positional record: `public record UserProfile(string Id, string Name);`
I will apply this change using EditFile.
</think>
I am modifying `src/Core/UserProfile.cs` to use record syntax.

### [ 00:10 ] 🔧 TOOL
**Tool Invocation:** `EditFile`
````json
