Build failed with 2 errors.
````

### [ 00:16 ] 🤖 ASSISTANT
The build encountered compiler error CS0117. I will attempt to edit the file again without checking dependent constructor references.

### Model calls (requests as sent to the model)
#### [ 00:01 ] Call 1
**Messages:** 2 total, 0 unchanged, 2 new
**Instructions:** unchanged
**Tools (4):** ReadFile, EditFile, RoslynSymbolQuery, ExecuteDotNetBuild
";

            await File.WriteAllTextAsync(sampleFile, sampleContent);
            ToastService.Show("Sample Generated", "Generated demo session transcript in docs/transcripts/", ToastLevel.Success);
            await LoadTranscriptsAsync();
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            ToastService.Show("Failed to Generate Sample", ex.Message, ToastLevel.Error);
        }
    }

    public void Dispose()
    {
        _disposed = true;
        WorkspaceState.OnWorkspaceChanged -= HandleWorkspaceChanged;
    }
}
